2026-10-25T10:11:23.2955690Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3672910Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3711240Z [0m
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3711750Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3712430Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3712800Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3713010Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3713590Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3713800Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3714010Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3714420Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3714620Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3715000Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [351..356])[0m and groups [34m(gid 350)[0m
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3715550Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3716840Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3717260Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3717460Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3717640Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3717840Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3718090Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3718520Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3718610Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3718830Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3719210Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3719600Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3720140Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3752540Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3753740Z I will:
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3755390Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3756150Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3757250Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3758370Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3759690Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3760650Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3761400Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3762280Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3762970Z    /var/root
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3810670Z  - back up /etc/bashrc to /etc/bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3815270Z  - update /etc/bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3879790Z  - back up /etc/zshrc to /etc/zshrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3883030Z  - update /etc/zshrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3884680Z  - create a Nix volume and a LaunchDaemon to mount it
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3885540Z  - create a LaunchDaemon (at /Library/LaunchDaemons/org.nixos.nix-daemon.plist) for nix-daemon
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3887770Z 
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3888160Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3888760Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
