2026-10-25T10:11:23.3932950Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3961200Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3966210Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-10-25T10:11:23.3966610Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
